</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6e7b792c-9439-11f1-a808-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T073402Z-1186824879-RC27UMAPJ23P-RTRMADP-3-ASIA-WEATHER-CHINA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6e7b792c-9439-11f1-a808-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T073402Z-1186824879-RC27UMAPJ23P-RTRMADP-3-ASIA-WEATHER-CHINA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">7b6ccae6-a078-11f1-8d41-71e6c46eff72</guid><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 11:31:14 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6e7b792c-9439-11f1-a808-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-09T073402Z-1186824879-RC27UMAPJ23P-RTRMADP-3-ASIA-WEATHER-CHINA.jpg">via REUTERS - cnsphoto</source><dc:creator>艾娃</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国报纸摘要</category><title>比亚迪为何押注“轻型純电海獭”抢滩日本市场？中国导弹加入后，高超音速威慑即将到来？</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD%E6%8A%A5%E7%BA%B8%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81/20260825-%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9A%E8%BF%AA%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E6%8A%BC%E6%B3%A8-%E8%BD%BB%E5%9E%8B%E7%B4%94%E7%94%B5%E6%B5%B7%E7%8D%AD-%E6%8A%A2%E6%BB%A9%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%AF%BC%E5%BC%B9%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E5%90%8E-%E9%AB%98%E8%B6%85%E9%9F%B3%E9%80%9F%E5%A8%81%E6%85%91%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%86%E5%88%B0%E6%9D%A5</link><description>
