</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/5fa8ca18-9e1f-11f1-8938-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T081857Z-1276085662-RC252NATWX7S-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-TECH-ROBOT.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/5fa8ca18-9e1f-11f1-8938-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-20T081857Z-1276085662-RC252NATWX7S-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-TECH-ROBOT.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e579587a-9e1e-11f1-ab7b-150653faafe5</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:48:56 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>呢喃</dc:creator></item><item><category>社会</category><title>TikTok就儿童隐私问题与美国司法部达成4亿美元和解</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A/20260822-tiktok%E5%B0%B1%E5%84%BF%E7%AB%A5%E9%9A%90%E7%A7%81%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E4%B8%8E%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E5%8F%B8%E6%B3%95%E9%83%A8%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%904%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E5%92%8C%E8%A7%A3</link><description>
