</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/862c4fa0-95ca-11f1-b903-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-05T100023Z-983009818-RC2TBCAHM0FA-RTRMADP-3-DISNEY-TIKTOK.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/862c4fa0-95ca-11f1-b903-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-05T100023Z-983009818-RC2TBCAHM0FA-RTRMADP-3-DISNEY-TIKTOK.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">7433688c-9e04-11f1-bbf6-976fc488f692</guid><pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 08:35:38 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/862c4fa0-95ca-11f1-b903-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-05T100023Z-983009818-RC2TBCAHM0FA-RTRMADP-3-DISNEY-TIKTOK.jpg">REUTERS - David Swanson</source><dc:creator>左依</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>应中联部邀请  日本跨党派议员代表团访华</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260822-%E5%BA%94%E4%B8%AD%E8%81%94%E9%83%A8%E9%82%80%E8%AF%B7-%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC%E8%B7%A8%E5%85%9A%E6%B4%BE%E8%AE%AE%E5%91%98%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%9B%A2%E8%AE%BF%E5%8D%8E</link><description>
